OL,3,GNEWSAMichael Sheen says he was snubbed
OL,4,Aby first minister over toxic pollution
OL,5,Aclaims
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn Parliament on Thursday, Sheen urged
OL,8,FMPs to back a national testing
OL,9,Fprogramme for historic toxic dumps to
OL,10,Fmake sure sites were safe, after high
OL,11,Flevels of cancer-causing chemicals -
OL,12,Fknown as PCBs - were found in soil
OL,13,Fsamples and in the blood of people
OL,14,Fliving near sites linked to chemical
OL,15,Fgiant Monsanto.
OL,17,FEastman Chemical Company, which is
OL,18,Fresponsible for its legacy production,
OL,19,Fwas asked to comment.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
